network switche on the 3rd floor of the Municipal building were not able to be placed on a warranty status from the vender/manufacturer last year
due to their age.  This switch provides connectivity to the workstations for uses to access the computer network.  These switches also provide
network connectivity for ShoreTel IP Phones on the 3rd floor and also power all phones via PoE (Power over Ethernet).
